62
00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.850
On evaluation media, every name also
contains Evaluation.

63
00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:16.300
Read the whole name before you select
Next, because you cannot convert between

64
00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.150
