Third, a password that is too simple.

151
00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:48.300
Use three of four character groups, or
simply the pod password.

152
00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.150
Fourth, creating partitions yourself.

153
00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.000
Select Unallocated Space and let setup do
the work.

